{"product_id":"killing-monica","title":"Killing Monica","description":"\u003cp\u003eIn Killing Monica Bushnell spoofs and skewers her way through pop culture, celebrity worship, fame and even the meaning of life itself, when a famous writer must resort to faking her own death in order to get her life back from her most infamous creation - Monica. With her trademark humour and style, Killing Monica is Bushnell's sharpest, funniest book to date.This is Bushnell at her best - full of mordant wit, casual sex and highly conspicuous consumption. \u003cbr\u003e\n Dimensions:156 x 235  \u003cbr\u003e\n Author: Candace Bushnell \u003cbr\u003e\n ISBN: 9781408703175 \u003cbr\u003e\n Format:  \u003cbr\u003e\n Pages 311\u003c\/p\u003e","brand":"bookloopbook.com","offers":[{"title":"Default Title","offer_id":43518500503705,"sku":"2RA9781408703175","price":20.0,"currency_code":"AED","in_stock":true}],"thumbnail_url":"\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0580\/5696\/6297\/products\/0a5c479ef4203fa8abce8fd9e81ef55b.jpg?v=1698046226","url":"https:\/\/bookloopbook.com\/products\/killing-monica","provider":"Dubai - Buy Used\/Second-Hand Books - Book Loop Book","version":"1.0","type":"link"}